// owners (DeclareSettingOwner) default to order 0, so they come after app and before ochazuke. A section row with no owner titles
// that section in every owner. Sections draw in the order of these rows (then an application's DeclareSettingSection rows), the
// sections nobody declared after them in the order of their first setting. A setting's owner and section come from its own row
// (Setting.Owner, Setting.Section, else the name before its first dot), never from code looking at its name.
